### storage/ — Directory Scaffold

```
security/storage/
├── encrypted/
│   ├── datasets/
│   ├── reports/
│   └── temporary/
├── decrypted_temp/
└── keys/
```

Created by `secure_storage.py` at import time using `mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)`.
`.gitkeep` files placed in each leaf so the structure is tracked in version control.

